lass=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$o$\">$o$</span>, define <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dV_g|_x$\">$dV_g|_x$</span> to be the unique alternating <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n$\">$n$</span>-form on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(T_xM,g_x,o_x)$\">$(T_xM,g_x,o_x)$</span> taking value <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$1$\">$1$</span> on every positively oriented orthonormal basis. The family <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$dV_g:x\\mapsto dV_g|_x$\">$dV_g:x\\mapsto dV_g|_x$</span> is the pointwise Riemannian volume form. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:oriented-orthonormal-frames","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-determinant","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-metric","title":"def:riemannian-metric","label":"def:riemannian-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-orientation","title":"def:smooth-orientation","label":"def:smooth-orientation"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-determinant","title":"prop:volume-form-determinant","label":"prop:volume-form-determinant"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-value-one","title":"prop:volume-form-value-one","label":"prop:volume-form-value-one"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-uniqueness","title":"prop:volume-form-uniqueness","label":"prop:volume-form-uniqueness"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:volume-form-coframe","title":"prop:volume-form-coframe","label":"prop:volume-form-coframe"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/L